<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44348" root="&#xA;                        هم&#xA;                    " body-key="h1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِمَّةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A thing that one meditates, purposes,</i> or
<i>intends to do;</i> or <i>that one desires to do;</i> or
<i>endeavours to do; a purpose; an intention;</i>
or <i>an object of desire,</i> or <i>of endeavour;</i> as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمَّةٌ</span></b> . (JK, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِمَّةٌ</span> [<i>Ambition;</i> particularly
<i>of a high kind;</i>] <i>a faculty firmly rooted in the
soul, seeking high things, and fleeing from base
things.</i> (Ibn-Kemál, in TA.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَعِيدُ</span>, and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمٌّ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِمَّةٌ</span> [<i>Mind; purpose; aspiration;
desire; ambition; enterprise; emprise.</i>] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِمَّةٌ عَالِيَةٌ</span>
                        <i>High purpose; ambition.</i>
